{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"medical_alcohol_clean","model_identifier":"","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{},"ai_used":true,"ai_agents":"bbmcp-cli","afl_rig":{"version":2,"repo":"D:/Minecraft Modding/AFL-survivor-v0","slim":false,"view_pitch":65,"first_person":false,"crouch":false,"breathing":false,"rifle":false,"props":[{"id":"bandage","group":"prop_bandage","scale":0.5,"D":[2,13.644,-4.1504],"hold":"axis","frame":"chest","items":["bandage"],"symmetry":"x","open_block":null,"about":"Health V1a (docs/gameplay/survival_health_v1a.md 7): the gauze roll in the right hand while the player action item/bandage_wrap winds it round the held-out left forearm. Drawn as the bandage's equipment mesh, parts roll and tail (tools/build-equipment-meshes-v1.mjs BANDAGE: 5.6 px wide, 4 px across, its axis along x; item offset 0.370357, client/AflStaticMeshItemClient), at half size. Points (item block units): center, the roll's middle; axis, 0.525 under it (4.2 px at this scale): the action's keys put it on the left forearm's middle line, so between keys the roll swings round the forearm, clear of the sleeve's corners and the wrap; pinch, 0.325 over the middle (2.6 px), where the right palm holds it from outside.","mesh":{"model":"bandage","atlas":"bandage_mesh","offset":0.37036,"parts":["roll","tail"]}},{"id":"medical_alcohol","group":"prop_medical_alcohol","scale":0.6,"D":[4.27008,9.79536,-4.8],"hold":"grip","frame":"chest","items":["medical_alcohol"],"symmetry":"z","open_block":null,"about":"Health V1a (docs/gameplay/survival_health_v1a.md 7): the medical alcohol bottle without its cap, held in the right hand by the player action item/alcohol_clean; the cap is the prop medical_alcohol_cap. Drawn as the bottle and label parts of the item's equipment mesh (tools/build-equipment-meshes-v1.mjs BOTTLE: 9.25 px tall, r 1.7 px, mouth at 9.0 px; item offset 0.2109375). Points (item block units): grip, where the right palm holds it, beside the body (the palm's middle 2.05 px off the bottle's side); mouth, the open mouth's middle; mouth_tip, 1 px further out along the axis (client/MedicalPourJets: the stream's way); base, the foot's middle.","mesh":{"model":"medical_alcohol","atlas":"medical_alcohol_mesh","offset":0.21094,"parts":["bottle","label"]}},{"id":"medical_alcohol_cap","group":"prop_medical_alcohol_cap","scale":0.6,"D":[1.2,6.39024,-4.8],"hold":"center","frame":"chest","items":["medical_alcohol"],"symmetry":"x","open_block":null,"about":"Health V1a (docs/gameplay/survival_health_v1a.md 7): the medical alcohol's screw cap on its own, the cap part of the bottle's equipment mesh (item units as the bottle's: on the bottle it sits where the item has it). The player action item/alcohol_clean has it ride the bottle while screwed (turning about the bottle's axis), then the left hand carry it. Points (item block units): center, the cap's middle on the bottle's axis; top, its top; grip, where the left palm holds it, 2.05 px past its top along the axis (the hand's palm face on the cap's top).","mesh":{"model":"medical_alcohol","atlas":"medical_alcohol_mesh","offset":0.21094,"parts":["cap"]}}]},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"skin_chest","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4,18,-2],"to":[4,24,2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,18,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"west":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4d3dbdf2-b098-2186-bb35-d6277e157d22"},{"name":"skin_pelvis","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4,12,-2],"to":[4,18,2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,12,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{